or key moments.\\n\\nArrange transportation\\n\\nBook transportation for wedding party and guests.\\n\\nSave to Dashboard\",\n  \"Wedding Attire\": \"\\nSchedule dress fittings\\n\\nAllow time for multiple fittings and alterations.\\n\\nChoose accessories\\n\\nSelect jewelry, veil, shoes, and other accessories.\\n\\nBook hair & makeup trial\\n\\nTest your look before the big day.\\n\\nCoordinate wedding party attire\\n\\nEnsure bridal party has their outfits ready.\\n\\nBreak in your shoes\\n\\nWear them around the house to avoid blisters.\\n\\nSave to Dashboard\",\n  \"Honeymoon Planning\": \"\\nChoose destination\\n\\nDecide on your dream honeymoon location.\\n\\nBook flights & accommodations\\n\\nSecure the best deals by booking early.\\n\\nCheck passport validity\\n\\nEnsure passports are valid for 6+ months past travel dates.\\n\\nPlan activities\\n\\nResearch and book any special experiences.\\n\\nArrange pet/house sitting\\n\\nEnsure everything at home is taken care of.\\n\\nSave to Dashboard\"\n}\n### Ran Playwright code\n```js\nawait page.evaluate('async () => { const sleep=ms=>new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,ms)); const out={}; for (let i=0;i<6;i++){ const heads=[...document.querySelectorAll(\\'main h3\\')]; const h=heads[i]; const name=h.innerText; h.click(); await sleep(400); const card=h.closest(\\'div[class*=\"rounded\"]\\')||h.parentElement; const txt=card.innerText; out[name]=txt.split(\\'0%\\')[1]||txt.slice(-400); h.click(); await sleep(200);} return out; }');\n```"
